& [IndependentContractChecks]
  + exact declaration-order shapes are forty-seven request fields one-hundred-thirteen receipt fields and eighteen manifest fields; all thirty-four active test locators resolve in the separate implementation matrix
  + decoded A1 and legacy key bytes must agree while their existing domain-specific fingerprint digests remain deliberately unequal; valid alternate signatures do not substitute a different key
  + unchanged legacy signature input is its existing domain then NUL then complete canonical payload including its checked payload digest; no new signer or signature grammar exists
  + legacy policy binds exact raw A1 policy envelope and A3 snapshot hashes without transport LF; manifest hashes include the single transport LF
  + expected A1 revision is an explicit chain association because the legacy policy has no revision field; neither that association nor the decision signature is promoted to signed A4 lineage
  + a positive unsigned-A4-rebinding test keeps the legacy decision signature bytes unchanged while associating another valid supplied observation; decision_signature_binds_a4_lineage remains false
  + direct u64 comparison implements issued <= observed < expires; issuance equality is within expiry equality is after and empty or inverted intervals refuse
  + both decision kinds both input classes all three interval outcomes and adverse revoked or unknown A3 assertions are exercised without suppressing descriptive evidence or granting operative revocation authority

