& [LimitsAndDecision]
  + the independent evidence reader does not import the fixture producer; it deliberately reuses the governed correspondence and signature implementations rather than claiming a second cryptographic implementation
  + explicit bounded regular/nonlink file checks require stable supplied files and do not provide an atomic filesystem snapshot or an operating-system sandbox
  + development builds tests scratch files and subprocesses are scoped verification infrastructure, not runtime effect authority
  + provider_unavailable and zero live and synthetic provider trials remain preserved; no WSL remote machine model download fallback physical preparation or foreign-work mutation
  + implementation_verified_ready_for_exact_attributed_publication; final ODCV-031 and ODCV-A04 publication evidence must follow in the immediate bookend
